WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.112
Section 6.

00:00:02.062 --> 00:00:04.725
Operational Stress Injuries.

00:00:04.725 --> 00:00:06.875
The invisible wounds.

00:00:06.875 --> 00:00:14.762
Post-traumatic stress disorder, depression, anxiety, and moral injury affect tens of thousands of Canadian veterans.

00:00:14.762 --> 00:00:20.587
Wait times for mental health services at Veterans Affairs routinely exceed 6 months.

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:25.912
The veteran suicide rate remains significantly higher than the general population.
